  "dispositions": [
    {
      "id": "NONFINDING-FURNITURE-COMPONENT-ID-INSPECTED-CONSUMERS-001",
      "disposition": "Local source-ID reuse is not shown to conflate distinct furniture instances in the inspected consumers.",
      "trace": "Builder numbers retained solid colliders from its own collider count; ArchitecturalFurniturePose copies each local source ID when placing a cuboid. The reviewed room camera independently enumerates layout placements for both subjects and blockers, assigns Owner::Furniture(index), and tests that owner in clear_line. The tactical furniture collider maps each recipe cuboid to a separate compound component using centre, angles and size, without the source ID; the server installs the resulting compound on each spawned SceneFurniture entity. The presentation path uses the instance entity and cached recipe meshes. These facts reject the specific inference that repeated local IDs alone merge instances in these paths. No collider, scene, camera or product code ran.",
      "limits": "Other consumers, ID expectations across all public APIs, layout uniqueness, error attribution, collision geometry, and general placement correctness remain open. This is not proof of global ID uniqueness or a blanket safety verdict.",
      "repair": "not applicable to this bounded suspicion; no implementation",
      "validation": "not performed; source-only evidence verification"
    },
    {
      "id": "NONFINDING-TURNED-CAP-INITIAL-WINDING-001",
      "disposition": "The initial bottom-cap point order alone does not establish an inverted stored triangle for the inspected nondegenerate authored cap.",
      "trace": "turned supplies the same initial centre/ring point order to both terminal caps and supplies -Y for the first and +Y for the last. LodMesh::push_triangle computes the geometric cross product and swaps the second and third indices when its dot product with the supplied normal is negative. For the CandleStand iron stem first cap, radius is 0.06 and the first ideal 30-degree sector has initial +Y area magnitude 0.06\u00b2 \u00d7 1/2 = 0.0018; the negative supplied normal causes the stored bottom index order to be reversed by that branch. The ordinary source test body that checks mesh winding was read but not executed.",
      "limits": "This analytical illustration assumes the nondegenerate ideal sector; exact product floating-point behavior, all profile producers, zero-radius or empty profiles, UVs, backface culling and visual output remain unverified. An initial negative dot is handled, not proof that all meshes are valid.",
      "repair": "not applicable to this bounded suspicion; no implementation",
      "validation": "not performed; source-only evidence verification"
    }
  ],
  "remaining": "Trace all furniture identity and geometry producers and consumers, profile admission and degenerate policy, historical aliases, all remaining source roles and every independent lens."
